        "content": "<p>init-4.29 got new Vector.Lemma.sum_append. However, it requires that both vectors share the same size.<br>\nI propose to change Vector.Lemmas.sum_append parameter from <code>{as₁ as₂ : Vector α n}</code> to <code>{as₁ : Vector α n} {as₂ : Vector α m}</code>.<br>\nMotivation:<br>\nI have defined:<br>\n<code>rotate_left x k = x.drop k ++ x.take k</code><br>\nand want to prove<br>\n<code>(rotate_left x k).sum = x.sum</code><br>\nusing <code>sum_append</code>.</p>",
